    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evoker</i> is a physics, level-based, first-person puzzle game. You are a nameless hero who finds himself stranded in a strange land with no memories of who he is or where he comes from. Luckily, shortly after you wake up, you meet Amalia. A godlike entity that seems to know how to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She tells you that you have to relive some moments of your past to remember who you are.  With her guidance, you begin to master <strong>the elements</strong> and start progressing through the world by solving puzzles. With every puzzle, Amalia reveals a little bit about your past. After progressing through a few levels, things seem to improve, but you start to feel a certain unease. Something doesn't fit, and by the end of your journey, that unease will transform into a deep and haunting realization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U<strong>se magically infused ancient technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.poster.avif?t=1752581642\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.webm?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.mp4?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore four diverse environments:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.poster.avif?t=1752581642\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.webm?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.mp4?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evoker</i> is a physics, level-based, first-person puzzle game. You are a nameless hero who finds himself stranded in a strange land with no memories of who he is or where he comes from. Luckily, shortly after you wake up, you meet Amalia. A godlike entity that seems to know how to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She tells you that you have to relive some moments of your past to remember who you are.  With her guidance, you begin to master <strong>the elements</strong> and start progressing through the world by solving puzzles. With every puzzle, Amalia reveals a little bit about your past. After progressing through a few levels, things seem to improve, but you start to feel a certain unease. Something doesn't fit, and by the end of your journey, that unease will transform into a deep and haunting realization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U<strong>se magically infused ancient technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.poster.avif?t=1752581642\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.webm?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/68bfd0966e0eb251a9d7b33de5d0f3b1.mp4?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore four diverse environments:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.poster.avif?t=1752581642\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.webm?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774730/extras/20768c14888e799af76802b9971c9851.mp4?t=1752581642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
